WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:05.366
Unit twenty-five. Taking Screen Breaks!

2
00:00:06.319 --> 00:00:11.019
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:11.069 --> 00:00:14.107
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.157 --> 00:00:18.255
Today we learn about Taking Screen Breaks. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.407
Break. Say it with me. Break!

6
00:00:26.894 --> 00:00:30.827
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

7
00:00:34.328 --> 00:00:38.054
Eyes. Say it with me. Eyes!

8
00:00:41.569 --> 00:00:45.400
Move. Say it with me. Move!

9
00:00:48.849 --> 00:00:52.616
Timer. Say it with me. Timer!

10
00:00:56.169 --> 00:01:00.602
Outside. Say it with me. Outside!

11
00:01:04.095 --> 00:01:07.995
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

12
00:01:11.442 --> 00:01:12.192
Balance. Say it with me. Balance!

13
00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:26.689
After some time on a screen, I take a break. I rest my eyes, move my body, or play outside. A timer can remind me to keep a healthy balance.

14
00:01:26.739 --> 00:01:32.577
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:39.829
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.879 --> 00:01:41.029
Eyes!

17
00:01:42.115 --> 00:01:47.505
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.555 --> 00:01:48.705
Rest!

19
00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:55.706
Did you know? Moving your body during a break helps your brain focus better afterwards!

20
00:01:55.756 --> 00:01:58.094
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:59.262 --> 00:02:07.301
Think and answer. What can you do during a screen break?

22
00:02:07.351 --> 00:02:08.501
Great answer!

23
00:02:09.495 --> 00:02:17.264
Congratulations, everyone! You finished Technology Grade 3. Keep exploring technology safely. Goodbye!

24
00:02:17.314 --> 00:02:21.255
Thank you, Ms. Emily! See you in Grade 4!

